    apply: "Reflect on your own mortality using Psalm 90 and write a prayer asking God to teach you to number your days. Speak with a family member about their hopes for eternity. Memorise John 11:25. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Read Hebrews 9:27-28 and John 11:17-27. Discuss the contrast between common attitudes to death and the Christian hope. Write one question about eternity you hope the course will answer.",
