    apply: "Comfort a grieving believer with Philippians 1:21-23 and 2 Corinthians 5:8. Examine your own hope and thank God that death is gain. Memorise Philippians 1:21. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Read Philippians 1:19-26 and 2 Corinthians 5:1-10. List what Paul says about death and the resurrection body. Discuss the different views and shared hope.",
