    apply: "Read Luke 16:19-31 slowly and ask what it says about your attitude to wealth and the needy. Share the gospel with someone this week. Memorise Matthew 10:28. Share your plan with a trusted friend or family member this week and ask them to check in with you, then thank God for any progress.",
    activity: "Read Luke 16:19-31 and Revelation 20:11-15. Discuss the passages' themes and the limits of what we can know. Share how to offer compassion to those who worry about loved ones.",
