    summary: "This session reviews the first half of the course on eternity, resurrection and final judgment. It draws together John 11:25, 1 Corinthians 15:20 and 55-57, Philippians 1:21, Matthew 10:28, Philippians 3:20-21, Isaiah 25:8, 1 Thessalonians 4:16-17, Acts 17:31, 2 Corinthians 5:10, John 3:36 and Romans 5:1. Learners take a mid-course test, discuss what they have learned and set goals for the second half.",
